cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "State of ATS 2026: employer-to-applicant-tracking-system attribution"
abstract: >-
  Which applicant tracking system runs the careers portal of each of 738 large
  employers, verified against the live portal rather than inferred from page
  markup. 704 rows verified; 551 publish the apply host that applications land
  on, so any row can be checked in a browser. Provenance is recorded per row.
type: dataset
